<title>LATVIA: Latvian T-bill yields fall further at auction.</title>
<headline>Latvian T-bill yields fall further at auction.</headline>
<dateline>RIGA 1997-01-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>All yields fell further at an auction of Latvian Treasury bills on Wednesday, including those on one-year paper, the finance ministry said.</p>
<p>One-year paper was last auctioned on December 4, 1996. All amounts are in millions of lats.</p>
<p>  MATURITY   AVG YLD (pct)  AVG LAST TIME  ISSUE    BID    SOLD</p>
<p> One month     6.35		 7.95	  0.50   2.38    0.50</p>
<p> Three month   7.00		 8.70	  0.50   4.59    0.50</p>
<p> Six month     7.84		 8.71	  0.50   3.40    0.50</p>
<p> Twelve month  8.21		12.37	 10.00  38.28   10.00</p>
<p>-- Riga newsroom +371 721 5240</p>
</text>
